description = "Milled timber, ready for construction. Worth more than raw timber, but not absurdly so - 2 Timber (2 gold) into 1 Lumber (5 gold) is a real but modest profit, unlike the flat 50-gold trade goods every recipe produced in the original Unity balance pass."
